# Syncing clients (iCloud/Dropbox) leave byte-identical "<name> 2.<ext>" copies
# behind. 62 of them are sitting in src/ right now, and the same artifact
# produced a `refs/remotes/origin/HEAD 2` that made every `git fetch` fail.
# Never let one get committed.
* 2.*
* 3.*

# Forening member data. This repo is PUBLIC and the member list carries home
# addresses and dates of birth for real people, because Københavns Kommune
# requires exactly those fields. The filled list lives on the kasserer's
# machine, never here. docs/templates/medlemsliste-TEMPLATE.csv is the empty
# template and is the ONLY member-list file that may be committed.
Medlemsliste*
medlemsliste*
!docs/templates/medlemsliste-TEMPLATE.csv
deltagerliste*
